 6V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M22 13a18.15 18.15 0 0 1-20 0\"></path><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-lg font-semibold\">Business Management Systems</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">One connected operating system for projects, teams, customers, and financial workflows.</p><span class=\"mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-primary opacity-0 transition-all group-hover:opacity-100\">Learn more <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-primary/5\" href=\"/services\"><div class=\"flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 text-lg font-semibold\">CRM Solutions</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Give revenue teams a complete customer view, intelligent follow-ups, and reliable forecasting.</p><span class=\"mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-primary opacity-0 transition-all group-hover:opacity-100\">Learn more <svg 