der text-foreground [a]:hover:bg-muted [a]:hover:text-muted-foreground w-fit rounded-full text-xs\">AI</span><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-lg font-semibold leading-snug transition-colors group-hover:text-primary\">Designing AI automation that earns operational trust</h3><p class=\"mt-3 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">A practical framework for choosing the right tasks, controls, and measures before scaling intelligent automation.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar-days size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path><path d=\"M8 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 18h.01\"></path></svg>July 8, 2026</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path></svg>7 min read</span></div></div></a><a class=\"group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-primary/5\" href=\"/blog/erp-modernization\"><div class=\"flex aspect-[16/9] items-center justify-center rounded-t-2xl overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/5 to-primary/10\"><img src=\"/images/hackernoon.jpg\" alt=\"A low-risk pa